"channel": "Vaccine Safety Research Foundation", "channel_url": "https://rumble.com/c/VaccineSafetyResearchFoundation", "duration": 7236, "uploader": "Vaccine Safety Research Foundation", "live_status": "was_live", "webpage_url": "https://rumble.com/v6tml4t-episode-178-measles-outbreak-update.html", "webpage_url_basename": "v6tml4t-episode-178-measles-outbreak-update.html", "webpage_url_domain": "rumble.com", "extractor": "RumbleEmbed", "extractor_key": "RumbleEmbed", "release_timestamp": 1747954801, "view_count": 12538, "like_count": 174, "dislike_count": 1, "description": "Join us this Thursday on VSRF LIVE for an in-depth discussion on the ongoing measles outbreak that began in Texas earlier this spring. Our special guests, Dr. Brian Hooker, PhD, and Polly Tommey, will provide their insights into the outbreak's origins, current spread, and broader public health implications.Show more As of mid-May, The C.D.C. has reported 1,024 confirmed cases, making 2025 the second highest year since the United States declared measles \"eliminated\" in 2000. Texas, New Mexico and Oklahoma now represent the largest single outbreak in that time. While the spread appears to be slowing, our guests urge continued vigilance during this particularly virulent outbreak, as well as discuss options for you to stay healthy and protect yourselves and the ones you love.\nTune in Thursday at 7 PM ET on VSRF LIVE for this critical conversation and as always, bring your best questions!\n7pm ET / 4pm PT\nSee you there!\nDonations are tax deductible and we need your support to continue our work into 2024. Or to text-to-donate, text VSRF to 53555 Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/fww1/0d/s8/1/9/L/Y/L/9LYLy.qR4e.1-small-Episode-178-Measles-Outbrea.jpg", "display_id": "v6rfovz", "fulltitle": "Episode 178: Measles Outbreak Update", "duration_string": "2:00:36", "upload_date": "20250520", "release_date": "20250522", "release_year": 2025, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1